  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien tango nuevo in the hard-accented Piazzolla style. Bandoneon playing sharp staccato chords and a crying lead; solo violin with chop strokes and glissando answers; marcato piano hammering the 3-3-2 rhythm; upright bass with arco slides and slapped accents. Dry chamber-room recording, hard attacks, nothing smoothed. A taut male tenor, clipped and breathless in the verses, full-voiced on the final chorus. 118 BPM, A minor. Tense, dramatic and finally triumphant. No pop drum kit, no autotune, no ballroom string pad, no EDM, no Latin-pop reggaeton beat.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早四點 魚市仔的地面\n冰角 咧滴水 電火白白\n上尾一尾 大尾的石斑\n囥佇中央 規个市仔恬恬\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n對面彼个 海產店的頭家\n伊的手 已經舉起來矣\n\n[Chorus]\n喊價 喊價 閣加一百\n伊加 我嘛加\n今仔日 這尾魚\n我欲紮轉去予師傅\n\n[Verse]\n拍賣的阿伯 喉嚨足大聲\n數字 一个一个 喝甲緊緊\n頭家 目睭共我 掃一下\n我的手 咧掣 嘛無放落\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n師傅講 毋通超過三千\n這馬已經 兩千九矣\n\n[Chorus]\n喊價 喊價 閣加五十\n伊停 我嘛停\n規个市仔 攏咧等\n啥人 先共手放落\n\n[Bridge]\n頭家 笑一下 搖搖頭\n伊的手 慢慢仔放落來\n\n[Chorus]\n喊價 喊價 我喊著矣\n兩千九百五 這尾是我的\n冰桶 抱咧 跤步輕輕\n師傅 今仔日有好菜\n\n[Outro]\n頭家 明仔載閣來拚",
